; The permanent, VISIBLE crit-threshold chip (rulings 2-4). step 5 is EventUnitAttack.SEQUENCE_STEP.
; turn_hit_to_crit - Weak Spot's step (buff_markerlight_weak_spot.tres carries the same 5);
; applies_when_holder_is 0 is APPLIES_WHEN.attacker. allow_tech is false: the card says WEAPONS.
; needs_confirmation stays false: the trait is a rule, not a choice. SP5: wears the SAME texture
; as mt_advanced_targeting_calculations.tres (ruling 2 - the trait's own glyph, not a new picture).
[resource]
